OL,3,AE-bikes seized by police sold on at
OL,4,Aauction, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FElectric motorbikes seized by police
OL,7,Fforces in the UK are being sold on at
OL,8,Fauction, despite some fears they could
OL,9,Fend up back in the hands of criminals,
OL,10,Fthe BBC can reveal.
OL,12,FThousands are confiscated annually
OL,13,Fbecause they are suspected of being
OL,14,Fdriven illegally, or used in a crime -
OL,15,Fmost are later destroyed, but a BBC
OL,16,Finvestigation has found some are sold
OL,17,Fon to members of the public in online
OL,18,Fauctions.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
