OL,3,AE-bikes seized by police sold on at
OL,4,Aauction, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FAcross the UK, police sold 161 e-bikes
OL,7,Flast year and 54 in 2024, although the
OL,8,Freal number could be higher because not
OL,9,Fevery force responded to the BBC's
OL,10,FFreedom of Information request.
OL,12,FSome of the forces said they had now
OL,13,Fended the practice, but others defended
OL,14,Fit as a way of putting "money back into
OL,15,Fpolicing".
